meta {
  name: 14. Cleanup - Delete Pipeline
  type: http
  seq: 22
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/datasets/:dataSetId/pipelines/:id
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  dataSetId: {{pgDataSetId}}
  id: {{pgPipelineId}}
}

tests {
  test("Pipeline deleted or already gone", function() {
    const status = res.getStatus();
    // 204=deleted, 404=already gone
    expect(status === 204 || status === 404).to.be.true;
  });
}

docs {
  **PostGIS saga step 14** — Delete the pipeline (cleanup).

  Removes the pipeline created in step 7. The DataSink (step 13) must already be deleted, since it references `pipeline_id`. The DATASET_DELETE saga (step 11) has already undeployed the NiFi flow.

  **Expected Response:** 204 No Content. 404 if already deleted. 400 if `pgPipelineId` is not set (first run).

  **System Impact:**

  | Layer | Effect |
  |---|---|
  | Backend | Pipeline record removed from `portal_backend` DB |
  | Pipeline engine | Pipeline already undeployed by the DATASET_DELETE saga |
}
